+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a 5,000-record store, the measured `SessionStart` hook cost at p50 was
+**11.9 ms** before `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path. After
+that change, the measured p50 was **1.05 ms**.
+
+The latter measurement includes two changes made at the same time: adding the
+trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter and adding the body `CHECK` constraint.
+Consequently, the before/after measurements describe the combined change set;
+they do not isolate the contribution of any one of the three changes.
